  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia World Bank Partnership in Vietnam Phase 2 (ABP2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment supports Vietnam&apos;s socio-economic development agenda and economic growth aspirations by sharing knowledge and strengthening policies and programs for key development priorities, with a particular focus on gender equality. The expected outcomes include strengthened development policies and programs, and shared knowledge with Government of Vietnam and other stakeholders. The Partnership has six focus areas: (i) Economic Management and Growth, (ii) Low Carbon Infrastructure Development, (iii) Mekong Delta Climate Resilience, (iv) Gender Equality, (v) Digital Transformation, and, (vi) Inclusion.</narrative>
  </description>
